#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Setup instructions for IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud to submit Qiskit SDK and "
"Qiskit Runtime jobs for users with email invitations"
msgstr ""
"Istruzioni di configurazione per IBM Quantum su IBM Cloud per inviare job "
"con Qiskit SDK e Qiskit Runtime per utenti con inviti via email"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up your IBM Cloud account - invited users"
msgstr "Configura il tuo account IBM Cloud - utenti invitati"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore urlendcoded, WQVY */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up your IBM Cloud account - invited users {#set-up-your-ibm-cloud-"
"account-invited-users}"
msgstr ""
"Configura il tuo account IBM Cloud - utenti invitati {#set-up-your-ibm-"
"cloud-account-invited-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not have an invitation from an administrator to join an account "
"that an administrator set up, contact your administrator.  If you need to "
"set up your own account, follow the steps in [Set up your IBM Cloud "
"account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr ""
"Se non hai ricevuto un invito da un amministratore per accedere a un account"
" che un amministratore ha configurato, contatta il tuo amministratore. Se "
"hai bisogno di configurare il tuo account personale, segui i passaggi "
"descritti in [Configura il tuo account IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can run workloads on IBM&reg; quantum processing units (QPUs) by setting"
" up an account on IBM Cloud&reg;. You will also need to [install and set up "
"Qiskit and Qiskit Runtime](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr ""
"Puoi eseguire carichi di lavoro su unità di elaborazione quantistica (QPU) "
"di IBM&reg; configurando un account su IBM Cloud&reg;. Dovrai anche "
"[installare e configurare Qiskit e Qiskit Runtime](/guides/install-"
"qiskit#local).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Your user account is associated with one or more "
"[instances](/guides/instances), identified by _Cloud Resource Names_ (CRNs) "
"that give access to IBM Quantum services. Additionally, a unique API token "
"(also called a key) is assigned to each account, allowing for IBM Quantum "
"access from Qiskit.  For instructions to choose a specific instance, see "
"[Connect to an instance](/guides/instances#connect-instance).\n"
msgstr ""
"Il tuo account utente è associato a una o più [istanze](/guides/instances), "
"identificate da _Cloud Resource Names_ (CRN) che forniscono accesso ai "
"servizi IBM Quantum. Inoltre, a ogni account viene assegnato un token API "
"univoco (detto anche chiave), che consente l'accesso a IBM Quantum da "
"Qiskit. Per istruzioni su come scegliere un'istanza specifica, consulta "
"[Connettiti a un'istanza](/guides/instances#connect-instance).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      The [IBM Quantum Platform dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) and the [Instances page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) list the instances that you can access.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"      La [dashboard di IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) e la [pagina Istanze](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) elencano le istanze a cui puoi accedere.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Set up to use IBM Cloud {#set-up-to-use-ibm-cloud}"
msgstr "Configurazione per usare IBM Cloud {#set-up-to-use-ibm-cloud}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Prima di iniziare {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Accept the email invitation.\n"
msgstr "Accetta l'invito via email.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Log in with an IBMid or Google account.  Note that the profile that you use "
"to log in to IBM Cloud or IBM Quantum Platform in this step is not your IBM "
"Cloud account.  After logging in, confirm your information and accept the "
"invitation to join the account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Accedi con un IBMid o un account Google. Tieni presente che il profilo che "
"usi per accedere a IBM Cloud o IBM Quantum Platform in questo passaggio non "
"è il tuo account IBM Cloud. Dopo aver effettuato l'accesso, conferma le tue "
"informazioni e accetta l'invito ad aderire all'account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Navigate back to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Torna a [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account "
"switcher in the header, as shown in the following image.\n"
msgstr ""
"Assicurati che l'account e la regione corretti siano selezionati nel "
"selettore di account nell'intestazione, come mostrato nell'immagine "
"seguente.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Choose the account that was invited in the email.\n"
msgstr "Scegli l'account che è stato invitato nell'email.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The region controls where your jobs are run and where the job data is kept. "
"You can access either region by using the same API key, but you can only see"
" and access the instances that were created in the region that you're logged"
" in to.\n"
msgstr ""
"La regione determina dove vengono eseguiti i tuoi job e dove vengono "
"conservati i dati dei job. Puoi accedere a entrambe le regioni utilizzando "
"la stessa chiave API, ma puoi vedere e accedere solo alle istanze create "
"nella regione in cui sei connesso.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is to "
"the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is to the right of the "
"account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.svg 'IBM "
"Quantum Platform header')\n"
msgstr ""
"    ![The IBM Quantum Platform header is shown.  The account switcher is to "
"the right of the search bar.  The region switcher is to the right of the "
"account switcher.](/docs/images/guides/cloud-setup/IQP-Header.svg 'IBM "
"Quantum Platform header')\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. Optional: Save your access credentials {#2-optional-save-your-access-"
"credentials}"
msgstr ""
"2. Facoltativo: salva le credenziali di accesso {#2-optional-save-your-"
"access-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you are using a trusted Python environment, such as a personal laptop, it"
" is recommended that you use the `save_account()` method to [save your "
"credentials locally](/guides/save-credentials).\n"
msgstr ""
"Se stai utilizzando un ambiente Python affidabile, ad esempio un laptop "
"personale, è consigliabile usare il metodo `save_account()` per [salvare le "
"credenziali localmente](/guides/save-credentials).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"cloud-save\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Connect Qiskit with your service instance {#3-connect-qiskit-with-your-"
"service-instance}"
msgstr ""
"3. Connetti Qiskit alla tua istanza del servizio {#3-connect-qiskit-with-"
"your-service-instance}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Initialize the service](/guides/initialize-account) in a **trusted Python "
"environment**\n"
msgstr ""
"[Inizializza il servizio](/guides/initialize-account) in un **ambiente "
"Python affidabile**\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Initialize the service in an **untrusted environment**](/guides/cloud-"
"setup-untrusted) (such as a public computer)\n"
msgstr ""
"[Inizializza il servizio in un **ambiente non affidabile**](/guides/cloud-"
"setup-untrusted) (ad esempio un computer pubblico)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"   * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"   * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Note\">\n"
"   * Segui [queste istruzioni](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) se vuoi connetterti utilizzando la REST API invece di Qiskit.\n"
"   * Se necessario, usa [queste informazioni](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) per configurare il firewall e abilitare l'accesso agli endpoint dell'API IBM Quantum.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

